  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thai Union Sustainable Shrimp Value Chain Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senior unsecured 5-year loan with sculped amortization, to be provided as an ADB A loan of $25 million in USD and $25m equivalent in THB, and an ADB B loan of $100 million. Proceeds of the facilities will finance TU&apos;s permanent working capital needs for the procurement of sustainable shrimp in Thailand and operating expenses associated with TU&apos;s sustainability budget for its sustainable shrimp commitment. Sustainability activities will include extension services, training and advisory, R&amp;D, certifications support, and pilot sustainability projects in Thailand. A complementing TA (funded by trust funds) will support the capacity building of shrimp farmers in Thailand in climate-smart aquaculture practices.</narrative>
  </description>
